        <ul class="pa-list-basic pa-list-basic--compact">
            <li><code>pa-code-keyword</code> - Keywords (purple, bold)</li>
            <li><code>pa-code-string</code> - String literals (green)</li>
            <li><code>pa-code-number</code> - Numbers (orange)</li>
            <li><code>pa-code-comment</code> - Comments (gray, italic)</li>
